      "text": "For your first orthopedic visit, it's helpful to bring any recent imaging like X rays or MRIs, plus records from other doctors related to your condition. Also, bring a list of your current medications and any questions you have. If you have insurance, bring your card too. If you need help getting records sent over, let me know.",
